== tests/fm-supervision-host.test.sh
ok - host: an attended close whose main session cannot be identified reaches main and runs no engine turn
ok - host: a decision close accepted away whose turn starts attended still reaches main unchanged
ok - host: an attended close whose task turns main-only before its turn still reaches main unchanged
ok - host+hook: an attended main-only pass-through rewakes main and keeps its successor watcher
ok - host+hook: a captain outcome beside a quiet record rewakes the present captain with no away note
ok - host+hook: a Claude home without config/supervision-host runs the host at the default engine, and an off file restores the plain arm
ok - host+hook: a close that turns main-only at its turn rewakes main and keeps its successor watcher
not ok - hook write failure: the Stop hook did not finish
